Subject: build/runtime fixes for the 2026 MSYS2 toolchain (UCRT64, GCC 16, GLib 2.90)

- bundled 7za: use GStatBuf with g_stat/g_lstat; GLib >= 2.90 on Windows defines it
  as struct _stat64 (same change as upstream, present in 1.7.2)
- ct_main.cc: include <windows.h> for GetModuleFileNameW, which the bundled spdlog
  headers do not pull in
- ct_filesystem.cc: accept the ucrt64 install layout next to mingw64 (as upstream);
  without it the data dir (styles, language specs, data files) resolves to a relative path
---
diff --git a/src/7za/CPP/Windows/FileDir.cpp b/src/7za/CPP/Windows/FileDir.cpp
index bd21685..92541e8 100644
